Z||000000||MooCow||10-14-2000||10:35 PM||||Has anyone done any trading from Fiero Bob??  I want to call him and see if he has a Fiero to trade for mine instead of driving all the way to Alabama but do not know if he can be trusted like Ed Parks.  Does anyone know him or know what he is about??<P>                           Thanks Ken<P>||||reg||5
Z||000001||cifc||10-14-2000||11:25 PM||||While I've never actually bought a car from Bob, He has done a lot of work for me.  HE's about a 4 hour drive from where I live, but if I ever need major work done.  I take it to him.  Actually, he's even came and picked my car up a couple of times.  You don't have to worry about dealing with Bob.  <BR>--Jason||||reg||14
Z||000002||mrfiero||10-15-2000||12:11 AM||||Bob is just as comparable to Ed and vice versa.  Both are very much into Fieros, to say the least.  <P>I have done business with both and would trust either with any of my Fieros.  <P>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Oreif||10-15-2000||12:19 AM||||A friend bought a Fiero that was at Bob's place. The day before we picked it up Bob went over the car and made sure all was in order. As for buying parts I have ordered lots of parts from him and have never been disappointed in the condition of the parts or his prices. I haven't had Bob do any work yet, but people in our local club have and nobody has had any problems or complaints.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||14
Z||000004||Indiana_resto_guy||10-15-2000||06:36 AM||||I've dealt with Bob before and wouldn't hesitate to do business with him again, he's a real straight shooter!||||reg||1
Z||000005||Monkeyman||10-15-2000||06:51 AM||||While I haven't bought any cars from Bob, either, I did buy an '87 GT cluster from him once.  I was in desperate need of one overnight.  He found one, sent it and didn't charge me an arm and a leg.  Something was wrong with the tach and he agreed to make it right (only problem is that I never got around to calling him back).  <P>What's his URL?  I can't seem to find it in my records anymore.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Old Lar||10-15-2000||07:15 AM||||Bob is in Paxton, Illinois.  Ed Parks is in Alabama.  Twin Lakes is <A HREF="http://twinlakesfiero.tripod.com" TARGET=_blank>http://twinlakesfiero.tripod.com</A> <P>TRY THIS ONE  <P>A very reliable and honest.  He has done a lot of work on my cars and does more than he charges for.<P>He does some radical things to Fieros: SHO conversion<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SHO2M.jpg">  <BR><p>[This message has been edited by Old Lar (edited 10-15-2000).]||||reg||14
